Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're seeing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep your guard up, Koichi,\Nand don't get any closer to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said look over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that his stand? JoJo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the coat rack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The killer is here, and he's\Ntrying to take the jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This would be when he\Ncomes to get his suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our evidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go blindly after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.10,0:00:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is his power?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, it's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.56,0:01:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.64,0:01:21.81,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}taisetsu na mono ubawaresou
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.64,0:01:21.81,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}Something important is being taken from me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.23,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}nichijou ni magirekonda akuma
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.81,0:01:24.23,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}By a demon that's thrust itself into my life
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.23,0:01:27.60,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion nara tokkuni kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.23,0:01:27.60,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}Everything is crumbling around me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.23,0:01:27.60,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion na toki kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.23,0:01:30.40,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}nanigenai soshite sarigenai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.23,0:01:30.40,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Living my life as if everything was fine
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.40,0:01:32.78,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}kizu ga nai uchi ni ubawareteita
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.40,0:01:32.78,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Until suddenly it was stolen away without warning
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.78,0:01:36.24,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}torikaeshi ni iku nara ima sa
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.78,0:01:36.24,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}This is my only chance to take it back
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.24,0:01:40.58,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}tsuranuita ya no youna surudosa de
