Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.29,0:02:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The owner blew up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The killer has a bomb stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how he got Shigechi! Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we couldn't\Nfind his body anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.86,0:02:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Koichi. Let him go. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.66,0:02:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we go after him now,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.82,0:02:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might actually have a shot at catching
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bastard who murdered\NReimi and Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to observe the situation\Nbefore making our move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be patient, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you even hear yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not gonna lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting a look at that name\Ntag would have been a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But given that jacket's size, we\Nknow he's about 175 centimeters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, he's an\Nunmarried office worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he were married, he wouldn't need\Nto come here to get a button fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's between the ages of 25 and 35.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from the look of the\Njacket, he's pretty damn rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The jacket's unique fabric and styling\Ntell us he tends to wear designer clothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even without a good look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This info alone just narrowed\Nour target down big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, that does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, we can't just\Nstay here sitting on our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.18,0:03:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy is a cold-blooded killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to chase him as much as\Nyou do, but we have to stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bomb stand is somewhere over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen it yet,\Nbut I know it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make our way out of the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.62,0:04:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you just know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you could know its\Nlocation if you haven't seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not the kind of killer to bomb and\Nrun after only offing that shop owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he was, his killing spree\Nwould have ended a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't like to leave behind evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means he intends to take us out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand that, but don't you think\Nyou're being a teensy bit overcautious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're wrong about this\Nand his stand isn't here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our murderer and evidence\Ncould be long gone by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Observing involves far more\Nthan just looking around.
