Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we'll die in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like what he was implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My reverb is more than strong\Nenough to keep us safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's matured a lot since it emerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:04:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.81,0:05:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro just doesn't take me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you asked me, that\Ndumb bomb stand is long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.08,0:05:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we'd have to be total\Nnumb nuts not to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.88,0:05:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was here all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll explode if I keep touching it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knocked it to shit, and the\Nthing's still in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum, bring forth the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to end this\Nbefore things get ugly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm disposing of\Nyou right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have stopped\Ntime and finished it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet you didn't see that one\Ncoming, did you, murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who dares pursue\NYoshikage Kira must be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll blow them to little pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They think they've won, but once Deadly\NQueen's heart attack finds its prey,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it won't rest until its target is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.16,0:06:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even Star Platinum had\Nenough power to destroy it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means it's practically invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay behind me, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hasn't taken any damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing we do seems to\Nface this thing whatsoever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see that. Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.42,0:07:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been hitting it so\Nhard you're starting to bleed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it still doesn't have\Na single scratch on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last time, get back, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll explode and take\Nus along for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.42,0:07:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to get rid of it.
