Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:07:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good freaking grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a first for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Stan's resilience is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.78,0:08:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way this is going, my confidence\Nwill break before it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now, Mr. Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going to be able\Nto hold out for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to destroy this\Nalarm clock from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you, you have to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a stand's controlled from a distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it only wields a fraction\Nof its full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the way it charges and\Nthe intensity of its explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its owner has to be nearby\Nfueling it with energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no other explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At most 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, based on what we've seen,\Nthe killer's 10 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, and?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 10 meters and Reverb\Nhas a range of 50 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can find that prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.98,0:08:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, just leave it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have one job, and it's to focus\Non protecting yourself with Reverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing else matters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're letting him get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy's long gone, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means we're dealing\Nwith a long-range stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:09:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I've seen enough of these\Nto know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.80,0:09:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its movements are too simple\Nfor a short-range stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's seen enough of them to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he off his rocker?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going up against an incredibly\Npowerful long-range stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.10,0:09:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The user has to be close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro didn't take me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll show him how much I've matured.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find the killer and\Nfinish him off by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten meter range.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.02,0:09:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.84,0:09:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he has the jacket with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.42,0:09:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's much farther than 50 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's outside Reverb's range.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean the killer\Nreally has the ability
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to control such a\Npowerful stand from afar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.16,0:10:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's aiming at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, the bomb stand is drawn\Nto whichever object it senses is hottest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would explain the range\Nand why it's still so powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use Reverb to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stopping time is useless at that distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sent Reverb 50 meters away\Nto track down the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good freaking grief, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum, once more the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It attacked the shop owner first\Nbecause of the hot liquid in his cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared to that, our\Nbody heat didn't register.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in Koichi's case, his frustration\Nincreased his temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it detects something hotter,\Nthen it moves on to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, time resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it's drawn to the highest\Ntemperature it can detect,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's making a beeline for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he planning? All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If body temperature is all\Nit takes to trigger this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then fire should be more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chotaro!
