Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.98,0:11:53.02,Eyecatch - Episode 15,Signbot,0,0,0,,{\pos(103,794)}Kira Yoshikage
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I let this happen? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chotaro, this is all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.02,0:12:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All because I went after that bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This wouldn't have happened if he hadn't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had to stop time and\Nsave me with that fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was not the sensation\Nof human flesh exploding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.84,0:12:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just too powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it detects a temperature hotter than\Nbody heat, it goes after that first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.78,0:12:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance to make a break for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to find a way to call Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be able to fix Mr. Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to find a phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.06,0:13:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lots of ways to start a fire in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.14,0:13:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll buy some time, and then\Nwe'll escape through that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a gas stove!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell does this house\Nhave to have an electric one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's gonna take forever to get hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on! The oven, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.56,0:13:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet that kettle has hot water in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try and fight me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like Mr. Jotaro said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to carefully observe. Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing has a weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.78,0:14:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never noticed it until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really starting to piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.52,0:14:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a repulsive murderer,\Na stain on the fabric of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.94,0:14:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should a Dark like\Nyou have the satisfaction
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of watching me flee and beg for mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't the roles be reversed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already know that I can get out of\Nthis mess alive, so for the life of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't figure out why I'm just standing\Nhere like a wimpy little bitch baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a bad case of the shits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had this all wrong\Nfrom the beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who should be\Nrunning away is you, dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.44,0:14:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ends once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're unrelenting in your\Npursuit of thermal energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's also your shortcoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your inability to stuff\Nwill be your undoing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for your crimes, so\Nconsider this the first installment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been three minutes\Nsince I made my escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's transpired at\Nthe shoe store in the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no matter how strong my\Nopponent There's one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of heart attack is the\Nultimate stand and has no weaknesses
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.96,0:15:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll find and destroy\Nany target without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, with that thing out of the way,\Nall that's left is to call Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should have made it\Nhome from school by now.
