Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.59,0:15:48.63,SFXRed,3,0,0,0,,{=31}{\blur0.6\bord0\fscx136.74\fscy113.95\frz4.052\pos(640.97,45.79)\shad4.56\4a&HFF&}Sizzle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.60,0:15:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least that pest is\Ndistracted for the time being.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.63,0:15:48.67,SFXRed,3,0,0,0,,{=31}{\blur0.6\bord4.55\fscx136.54\fscy113.79\shad4.55\frz4.052\pos(642.37,53.59)\c&H392652&}Sizzle
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.63,0:15:48.67,SFXRed,3,0,0,0,,{=31}{\blur0.6\bord0\fscx136.54\fscy113.79\frz4.052\pos(642.37,53.59)\shad4.55\4a&HFF&}Sizzle
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.67,0:15:48.71,SFXRed,3,0,0,0,,{=31}{\blur0.6\bord4.56\fscx136.83\fscy114.02\shad4.56\frz4.052\pos(642.94,44.36)\c&H392652&}Sizzle
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.67,0:15:48.71,SFXRed,3,0,0,0,,{=31}{\blur0.6\bord0\fscx136.83\fscy114.02\frz4.052\pos(642.94,44.36)\shad4.56\4a&HFF&}Sizzle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it'll fool it forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.56,0:15:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the sizzle should keep it busy\Nlong enough to make a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:16:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the little jackass is as gullible as\Na donkey chasing a hanging carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's your stance fatal flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gashkata residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.16,0:16:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, it's Koichi, I need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's hurt, I don't\Nthink he's gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kinda my fault, but\Nstill, get here fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to run that by me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just focus on getting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.52,0:16:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were following a hunch at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but long story short, I'm\Nholding his stand captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, holding it captive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.58,0:16:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I turned this thing off a while ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so why in the world is it\Njust starting to heat up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.80,0:16:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is with this heap of junk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.38,0:16:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how anybody\Ncooks a damn thing with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me where you are so I can find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's totally ignoring Reverb's writing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.28,0:17:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and tell me, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.22,0:17:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're at Mukadeya Shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.39,0:17:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverb's tail is still attached to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt, not only did it blow up,\Nthe damage got transferred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was not the sensation\Nof human flesh exploding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what I didn't need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting ready to attack, but\NI can't use Reverb's tail anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.56,0:17:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's my next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I fight back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, River, act two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,River, act two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.88,0:17:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:17:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Act two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.74,0:17:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you showing yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:17:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.05,0:18:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Act two must have been\Nkilled in the explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just the husk of his former self!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't freak out just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it died in that blast,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I should have been killed\Ntoo, but that didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.68,0:18:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, it's coming back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the first time Reberb\Nhas looked like a lifeless shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.38,0:18:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
