Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, if that's you, your new\Nform looks a lot different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.52,0:18:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Act three, awaiting orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I was right. I told Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro my powers had matured.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.20,0:18:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the best stand ever,\Nact three, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still awaiting your orders. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:19:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not all that familiar with\Nyour new capabilities so for
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now I guess just protect us\Nfrom harm get to it act three
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I mean, please keep\Nus safe back three sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do that right command acquired
