Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:20:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the heck happened out there,\NAct 3? Too strong. There's no hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we have to find some!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're doing battle with an adversary\Nthat possesses Herculean strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to face the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're S-H-I-T out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.68,0:20:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I commanded you to protect us from harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so get your butt in gear\Nand start protecting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The act of protecting\Nyou has been completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly as you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.04,0:20:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been completed, but\Nyou said we should give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.90,0:20:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're malfunctioning!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.26,0:20:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't made the\Nslightest bit of progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This skirmish is taking far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is keeping Heart Attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It normally makes the kill by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.72,0:20:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My left hand feels as\Nheavy as a cement block.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was the hand that I\Nreleased heart attack with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.37,0:21:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope everything's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.90,0:21:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I help at all? No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring me the bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please allow me to pay for the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something that needs\Nmy attention, so hop to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This indentation!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is my left hand so heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.16,0:21:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.96,0:21:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My left hand weighs a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like there's a massive\Nweight pressing against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is happening over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.28,0:21:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you need some assistance, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, everything's just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.59,0:21:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.30,0:21:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good heavens, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it something I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been driven so far into the\Npavement, it's barely moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.22,0:21:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, Act Three, what's this new ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.56,0:21:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three frees.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three and free.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:21:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It works because they rhyme.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:22:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's nice, but it\Ndoesn't answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know why the\Nbomb stand's barely moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me hanging.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.38,0:22:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I did just tell you\Nthey rhyme, Master Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.34,0:22:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need I say any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.18,0:22:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea how those\Nmentalsome twits did it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but somehow they were able\Nto weigh down heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.56,0:22:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, how did it come to this?
